    "updated_at": "2021-09-07T16:04:37Z",
    "body": "Chromium (as well as webkit AFAIK) coalesces requests of many types, not just images.\r\nThis is slightly orthogonal to the preload cache, at least in the Chromium implementation. That is not to say that it shouldn't be covered in spec, but maybe by a slightly separate concept. (e.g. can we expand the \"list of available images\" to be the \"list of available resources\"?)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
