    "created_at": "2021-09-08T06:35:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-08T06:35:59Z",
    "body": "Can you elaborate on why it should be a separate concept? Do images essentially go through two caches before hitting the innards of fetch? Is the difference observable?",
